{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "これでこそ完璧なヒ…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おひさまに向かって〜ひら砲〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鳥取県出身 ひらほーこと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "平尾帆夏(ひらおほのか)です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなた坂ライブまであと一週間と少し…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もミーグリでたくさん応援メッセージをもらってキアイマシマシです🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくれたみんなありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四・五期生だけのライブって初めてで、大好きで偉大な先輩方が見ても頷いてもらえるようなものにしたいから、闘魂注入したい時はアザトカワイイのMVを観ています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしててね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobeOXL8e.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すっかり夏だね〜〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日は\"米フェス\"こと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『ながおか米百俵フェス 〜花火と食と音楽と〜 2026』に出演させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📍 新潟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "念願の新潟県！この日食べたものでいちばん感動したのは、やはりおにぎり🍙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お土産にもコシヒカリを500ｇ買ったよー🌾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうやってフェスで地方に行くのが最高に楽しくて、普段はなかなかお会いできないおひさまとも会えてとーっても幸せでした！！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobmIVQTP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mob7tjuXk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遠くからでも見つけやすいように"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でこだししたよー！🌺✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなたフェスはどうしよっかな〜〜🤭"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobmRwPtn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美月ちゃんにお耳ついててかわいいʕ•ᴥ•ʔ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日一緒にリハを頑張ってるふたり!!"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆうさんライブ終わったら一緒にゲームしようねぇ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobEsJtqo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "塩分ﾁｬｰｼﾞ持ってるまりぃｻﾝ🍧"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "正直茉莉さんのことどぅあいすきです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日のひなあい観てねっ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobpPn5Ey.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まなみ氏とは低い声でコーヒーでも飲みながら※飲めないけど"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しっとり語りたくなるような空気感。☕️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobQPQ0PO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "源平合戦〜"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "陽子の方が髪が長いという数年前には考えられない事実…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "\\のびのび〜/"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202606/mobjQv1BO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自然しか勝たんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだブログに書きたいこといっぱい…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来週はリアミにひなた坂LIVEに！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会えるの楽しみにしてます🎶"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も最後まで読んでくれてありがとう☺️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また次回のブログでお会いしましょう💖❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "栽培①-3"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⛈️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⚡️"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌷！？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "✎ オートセーブました…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#hirahoblog  # 189"}], "source": "official"}